---
<section id="licensing" class="bg-background">
  <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-6 py-24">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h1 class="text-[68px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-4.08px] font-normal text-[#131313] mb-6">
        Licensing
      </h1>
      <p class="text-[16px] text-[#4e4e4e] max-w-[600px] mx-auto leading-[1.5]">
        Information about asset licensing and usage rights for this template.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-12">
      <div class="bg-surface rounded-[20px] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-[36px] tracking-[-2.16px] font-normal text-foreground mb-6">Assets</h2>
        <p class="text-[16px] text-[#4e4e4e] leading-[1.5]">
          All graphical assets in this template are licensed for personal and commercial use. If you'd like to use a specific asset, please check the license below.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-surface rounded-[20px] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-[36px] tracking-[-2.16px] font-normal text-foreground mb-6">Fonts</h2>
        <p class="text-[16px] text-[#4e4e4e] leading-[1.5]">
          <a href="https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Inter" class="text-[#5f58ff] underline">Inter</a> — open-source font from Google Fonts.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-surface rounded-[20px] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-[36px] tracking-[-2.16px] font-normal text-foreground mb-6">Icons</h2>
        <p class="text-[16px] text-[#4e4e4e] leading-[1.5]">
          The icons used in are from <a href="https://iconify.design/" class="text-[#5f58ff] underline">iconify.design</a>. You can download and edit as you like.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-surface rounded-[20px] p-8">
        <h2 class="text-[36px] tracking-[-2.16px] font-normal text-foreground mb-6">Images</h2>
        <p class="text-[16px] text-[#4e4e4e] leading-[1.5] mb-4">
          All visuals in this template are either original designs or generated using AI tools.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[16px] text-[#4e4e4e] leading-[1.5] mb-4">
          These images are free to use within this template under a CC0 (Public Domain Dedication) license, meaning you can use them without attribution.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[16px] text-[#4e4e4e] leading-[1.5]">
          For all other works, please credit <a href="http://temlis.com/" class="text-[#5f58ff] underline">temlis.com</a> as an open-source resource.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
